  "notes_for_editor": "The 1923, 1930, 1934 and 1964 dates come only from the two lookout-history pages, which list identical dates; the county inventory confirms only the agency and township-range-section code. No staffing history is published, so none is in the story. No source describes the site today. A search result described the agency's later name, Clearwater-Potlatch Timber Protective Association (C-PTPA); that page was not read, so the story uses the older name the inventory gives. The 1930 entry is a log cabin, and no source says whether it replaced the 1923 platform. The brief record needs no correction.",
